{"ticker":"HBAN","updated":"2026-11-06T23:59:54Z","profile":{"longName":"Huntington Bancshares Incorporated","shortName":"Huntington Bancshares Incorpora","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United States","website":"https://www.huntington.com","fullTimeEmployees":25898,"marketCap":31178041344,"trailingPE":12.680327,"forwardPE":8.852445,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.1765707,"pegRatio":1.87,"targetMeanPrice":18.77895,"targetHighPrice":22.5,"targetLowPrice":17.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.322,"earningsGrowth":-0.195,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.39880002,"profitMargins":0.25369,"totalRevenue":9815000064,"beta":0.979,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":19.46,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":14.82,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.97},"summary":"Huntington Bancshares Incorporated operates as the bank holding company for The Huntington National Bank that provides commercial, consumer, and mortgage banking services. It offers financial products and services to consumer and business customers, including deposits, lending, payments, mortgage banking, dealer financing, investment management, trust, brokerage, insurance, and other financial products and services. The company also provides 24-Hour Grace, Asterisk-Free Checking, Money Scout, $50 Safety Zone, Standby Cash, Early Pay, Instant Access, Savings Goal Getter, And Huntington Heads Up; digitally powered consumer and business financial solutions to consumer finance, regional banking, branch banking, and wealth management customers; direct and indirect consumer loans; dealer finance loans and deposits; and private banking, wealth management and legacy planning through investment and portfolio management, fiduciary administration and trust, institutional custody, and full-service retail brokerage investment services. In addition, it offers equipment financing, asset-based lending, distribution finance, structured lending, municipal financing solutions, and Huntington ChoicePay. Additionally, the company provides lending, liquidity, treasury management and other payment services, and capital markets; government and non-profits, healthcare, technology and telecommunications","summary_zh":"Huntington Bancshares Incorporated 是亨廷頓國家銀行的銀行控股公司，提供商業、消費者和抵押銀行服務。它為消費者和企業客戶提供金融產品和服務，包括存款、貸款、支付、抵押銀行、經銷商融資、投資管理、信託、經紀、保險以及其他金融產品和服務。該公司還提供 24 小時寬限、無星號支票、Money Scout、50 美元安全區、備用現金、提前付款、即時訪問、Savings Goal Getter 和 Huntington Heads Up；為消費金融、區域銀行、分行銀行和財富管理客戶提供數位化的消費者和商業金融解決方案；直接和間接消費貸款；經銷商融資貸款和存款；透過投資和投資組合管理、信託管理和信託、機構託管以及全方位零售經紀投資服務，提供私人銀行、財富管理和遺產規劃。此外，它還提供設備融資、資產貸款、分銷融資、結構性貸款、市政融資解決方案和 Huntington ChoicePay。此外，該公司還提供貸款、流動性、資金管理和其他支付服務以及資本市場；政府和非營利組織、醫療保健、技術和電信","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 區域","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":17.68,"h":17.75,"l":17.39,"c":17.73,"v":33323600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":17.69,"h":17.86,"l":17.54,"c":17.64,"v":24654500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":17.66,"h":17.77,"l":17.55,"c":17.66,"v":27277500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":17.7,"h":17.77,"l":17.54,"c":17.74,"v":27603300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":17.69,"h":17.85,"l":17.64,"c":17.77,"v":21711200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":17.79,"h":17.86,"l":17.6,"c":17.63,"v":27325200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":17.62,"h":17.62,"l":17.2,"c":17.43,"v":26061100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":17.31,"h":17.8,"l":17.27,"c":17.54,"v":27999600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":17.62,"h":17.9,"l":17.47,"c":17.87,"v":32520400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":17.9,"h":17.93,"l":17.71,"c":17.72,"v":36152300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":17.64,"h":17.71,"l":17.3,"c":17.33,"v":21664700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":17.36,"h":17.65,"l":17.3,"c":17.35,"v":25576300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":17.37,"h":17.5,"l":17.23,"c":17.37,"v":26007200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":17.28,"h":17.43,"l":17.16,"c":17.32,"v":25231600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":17.44,"h":17.57,"l":17.3,"c":17.42,"v":25778200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":17.5,"h":17.52,"l":17.17,"c":17.35,"v":33740200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":17.36,"h":17.52,"l":16.96,"c":17.27,"v":33471900},